TITLE:: SCVisuals
summary:: Legacy namespace and facade forwarding to Probe
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeTheme, Classes/ProbeBroker

DESCRIPTION::
SCVisuals is the legacy namespace for the real-time audio analysis suite, maintained for backward compatibility. All visualizers and measurement tools have been unified under the link::Classes/Probe:: namespace.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: version
Returns the current version string.

METHOD:: broker
Returns the default singleton link::Classes/ProbeBroker:: instance.

METHOD:: theme
Get or set the current active link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Optional theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme:: to set.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: scale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: themes
Returns the dictionary of all registered themes.

METHOD:: sources
Returns the dictionary of all active measurement sources managed by the broker.

METHOD:: freeAll
Frees all active measurement sources, osc responders, and subscriptions.

METHOD:: meter
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*meter::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: numIns
Number of inputs.

ARGUMENT:: numOuts
Number of outputs.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme symbol.

ARGUMENT:: density
Density preset.

ARGUMENT:: meterStyle
Meter style.

METHOD:: scope
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*scope::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio or control bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Channel count.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme symbol.

ARGUMENT:: rate
Rate symbol.

ARGUMENT:: style
Display mode symbol.

ARGUMENT:: bufSize
Buffer size.

METHOD:: spectrum
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*spectrum::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index.

ARGUMENT:: fftSize
FFT frame size.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme symbol.

ARGUMENT:: freqMode
Frequency axis mode.

ARGUMENT:: dbRange
dB range.

METHOD:: spectrogram
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*spectrogram::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numBands
Number of bands.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme symbol.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update frequency.

METHOD:: waterfall
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*waterfall::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numBands
Number of bands.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme symbol.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update frequency.

ARGUMENT:: numLines
Line count.

METHOD:: history
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*history::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: busType
Bus type symbol.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Channel count.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme symbol.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update frequency.

ARGUMENT:: maxPoints
History max points.

METHOD:: loudness
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*loudness::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: busType
Bus type symbol.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Channel count.

ARGUMENT:: theme
