ARGUMENT:: targetLUFS
Target LUFS.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update frequency.

METHOD:: vectorscope
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*vectorscope::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Bus index.

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme symbol.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Update frequency.

METHOD:: dashboard
Convenience forwarder to link::Classes/Probe#*dashboard::.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target Server.

ARGUMENT:: numIns
Input count.

ARGUMENT:: numOuts
Output count.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
