ARGUMENT:: targetLUFS
Target LUFS.

EXAMPLES::

code::
// Inspect version and active theme
SCVisuals.version.postln;
SCVisuals.theme.postln;

// Switch theme
SCVisuals.theme = \phosphor;
SCVisuals.theme = \graphite;
::
